msgstr "`@Find` 方法根据其参数生成查询，并可返回一个实体、一个可选对象或一组实体。Hibernate 文档中包含了 link:https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/{hibernate-orm-version-major-minor}/introduction/html_single/#generated-finder-methods[生成的查找器方法的] 完整 link:https://docs.hibernate.org/orm/{hibernate-orm-version-major-minor}/introduction/html_single/#generated-finder-methods[参考] 。"

